From 8b58d348d6f9c82aa76ac7253695218768d8b178 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AsdreamChan <53651187+AsdreamChan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 12:05:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] imx8mp_frdm: boot the yongchun-tpg composite device tree by
 default

The yongchun image ships imx8mp-frdm-tpg.dtb, the board's tree with the
two yongchun,tpg test devices merged in at build time. Make it the
default fdtfile so the devices exist at boot and their driver loads
without a hand-applied overlay.

imx8mp-frdm.dtb is still on the boot partition; `setenv fdtfile
imx8mp-frdm.dtb; boot` at the prompt boots the plain tree.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [yongchun-specific default]

Signed-off-by: AsdreamChan <53651187+AsdreamChan@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 configs/imx8mp_frdm_defconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/configs/imx8mp_frdm_defconfig b/configs/imx8mp_frdm_defconfig
index 7dd36957..9b61cb37 100644
--- a/configs/imx8mp_frdm_defconfig
+++ b/configs/imx8mp_frdm_defconfig
@@ -38,7 +38,7 @@ CONFIG_OF_BOARD_FIXUP=y
 CONFIG_OF_BOARD_SETUP=y
 CONFIG_OF_SYSTEM_SETUP=y
 CONFIG_BOOTCOMMAND="run sr_ir_v2_cmd;bootflow scan -lb; run bsp_bootcmd"
-CONFIG_DEFAULT_FDT_FILE="imx8mp-frdm.dtb"
+CONFIG_DEFAULT_FDT_FILE="imx8mp-frdm-tpg.dtb"
 CONFIG_ARCH_MISC_INIT=y
 CONFIG_BOARD_EARLY_INIT_F=y
 CONFIG_BOARD_LATE_INIT=y
